<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.8.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        /* Custom styles */
        .hero-section {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)), url('/images/cotton-field.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            color: white;
            padding: 120px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-section h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-section p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
        }

        .feature-card {
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            height: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .benefits-section {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .benefit-item {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .benefit-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background-color: #198754;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .tech-section {
            padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .tech-logo {
            height: 60px;
            margin: 20px;
            opacity: 0.7;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .tech-logo:hover {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .cta-section {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #198754, #20c997);
            color: white;
            padding: 80px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .testimonial-content {
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .testimonial-author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .testimonial-avatar {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 15px;
            background-color: #dee2e6;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #6c757d;
        }

        .partner-logo {
            max-height: 60px;
            margin: 20px;
            opacity: 0.8;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .partner-logo:hover {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .how-it-works {
            position: relative;
            padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .how-it-works::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 150px;
            bottom: 150px;
            left: 50%;
            width: 4px;
            background-color: #20c997;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        .step-box {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .step-number {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background-color: #198754;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .step-content {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-top: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .qr-demo {
            max-width: 150px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        #scrollTopBtn {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            z-index: 99;
            font-size: 18px;
            border: none;
            outline: none;
            background-color: #198754;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
        }

        .sustainability-metrics {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .sustainability-metric {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .sustainability-bar {
            height: 10px;
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 5px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .sustainability-progress {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #198754;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-success fixed-top">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">SustainableFashionChain</a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link active" href="/">Home</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/analytics">Analytics</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/batches">Batches</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/products">Products</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/marketplace">Marketplace</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/api-docs">API Docs</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <div class="d-flex">
                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline-light me-2">Login</a>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-light">Register</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Sustainable Fashion Supply Chain on Blockchain</h1>
            <p>Track cotton from farm to product with complete transparency, tokenize commodities, and build trust with consumers through verifiable sustainability.</p>
            <div>
                <a href="/batches" class="btn btn-success btn-lg me-3">Explore Platform</a>
                <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">How It Works</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">Our Platform Features</h2>
                <p class="lead">Combining Hyperledger Fabric for supply chain traceability with Ethereum for tokenization</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card feature-card">
                        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                            <div class="feature-icon text-success">
                                <i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Traceable Supply Chain</h3>
                            <p class="card-text">Track every step from farm to final product with immutable blockchain records for complete transparency.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card feature-card">
                        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                            <div class="feature-icon text-primary">
                                <i class="bi bi-coin"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Commodity Tokenization</h3>
                            <p class="card-text">Convert physical cotton into digital tokens for transparent trading and financial flexibility.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card feature-card">
                        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                            <div class="feature-icon text-warning">
                                <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Product NFTs</h3>
                            <p class="card-text">Create unique digital twins for products with verifiable provenance and sustainability credentials.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card feature-card">
                        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                            <div class="feature-icon text-info">
                                <i class="bi bi-recycle"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Circular Economy</h3>
                            <p class="card-text">Incentivize recycling, repair, and resale activities with token rewards for sustainable behavior.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card feature-card">
                        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                            <div class="feature-icon text-danger">
                                <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Certifications Verification</h3>
                            <p class="card-text">Validate organic, fair trade, and other certifications with secure, tamper-proof blockchain records.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card feature-card">
                        <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                            <div class="feature-icon text-secondary">
                                <i class="bi bi-graph-up"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Analytics Dashboard</h3>
                            <p class="card-text">Gain insights with comprehensive analytics on sustainability metrics, supply chain activity, and more.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How It Works Section -->
    <section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">How It Works</h2>
                <p class="lead">Follow the journey from cotton field to consumer, powered by blockchain technology</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-6 offset-md-3">
                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">1</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Cotton Registration</h4>
                            <p>Farmers register cotton batches on the blockchain, recording quantity, location, and sustainable growing practices.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">2</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Certification Verification</h4>
                            <p>Third-party certification bodies verify organic, fair trade, and other credentials directly on the blockchain.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">3</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Supply Chain Tracking</h4>
                            <p>Cotton moves through the supply chain with each custody transfer recorded on Hyperledger Fabric.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">4</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Cotton Tokenization</h4>
                            <p>At a verified warehouse, physical cotton is tokenized on Ethereum, creating digital assets backed by the commodity.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">5</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Product Creation & NFT Minting</h4>
                            <p>Manufacturers create products using tracked cotton and mint NFTs with complete provenance data.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">6</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Consumer Verification</h4>
                            <p>Consumers scan QR codes to verify product authenticity, view supply chain history, and sustainability metrics.</p>
                            <div class="qr-demo">
                                <img src="/images/qr-sample.png" alt="QR Code Example" class="img-fluid" onerror="this.src='data:image/png;base64,'">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <div class="step-number">7</div>
                        <div class="step-content">
                            <h4>Circular Economy Rewards</h4>
                            <p>Consumers earn rewards for sustainable actions like recycling, repair, and reselling products.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Benefits Section -->
    <section class="benefits-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">Benefits For Every Stakeholder</h2>
                <p class="lead">Our hybrid blockchain solution creates value throughout the entire supply chain</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">
                            <i class="bi bi-tree"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>For Cotton Farmers</h3>
                        <p>Verify sustainable growing practices, access premium markets, and receive fair prices with transparent transactions.</p>
                        <div class="sustainability-metrics">
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Income Stability</span>
                                    <span>+35%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 35%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Market Access</span>
                                    <span>+62%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 62%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">
                            <i class="bi bi-building"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>For Manufacturers</h3>
                        <p>Verify sustainable material sourcing, reduce compliance costs, and build consumer trust with transparent supply chains.</p>
                        <div class="sustainability-metrics">
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Certification Costs</span>
                                    <span>-45%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 45%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Traceability Time</span>
                                    <span>-82%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 82%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">
                            <i class="bi bi-shop"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>For Retailers</h3>
                        <p>Validate sustainability claims, reduce returns with product authentication, and increase consumer trust and loyalty.</p>
                        <div class="sustainability-metrics">
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Return Rate</span>
                                    <span>-38%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 38%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Consumer Trust</span>
                                    <span>+74%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 74%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-icon">
                            <i class="bi bi-person"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>For Consumers</h3>
                        <p>Verify product authenticity, make informed sustainable choices, and earn rewards for circular economy participation.</p>
                        <div class="sustainability-metrics">
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Decision Confidence</span>
                                    <span>+85%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 85%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sustainability-metric">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span>Sustainability Impact</span>
                                    <span>+67%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sustainability-bar">
                                    <div class="sustainability-progress" style="width: 67%;"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Technology Section -->
    <section class="tech-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">Powered by Advanced Technology</h2>
                <p class="lead">Our hybrid blockchain architecture leverages best-in-class technologies</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-md-10">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="text-success">Hyperledger Fabric</h3>
                                    <p>Permission-based blockchain for sensitive supply chain data with high performance and privacy controls.</p>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>Private, permissioned network</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>High transaction throughput</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>Flexible endorsement policies</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>Channel-based data isolation</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="text-primary">Ethereum</h3>
                                    <p>Public blockchain for tokenization, NFTs, and circular economy incentives with DeFi integration.</p>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary me-2"></i>ERC-20 commodity tokens</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary me-2"></i>ERC-721 product NFTs</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary me-2"></i>Smart contract automation</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary me-2"></i>DeFi ecosystem integration</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="text-warning">Oracle Integration</h3>
                                    <p>Real-world data feeds for commodity pricing, weather conditions, and other critical information.</p>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i>Market price feeds</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i>Weather data for growing regions</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i>Parametric insurance triggers</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i>Carbon credit validation</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="text-danger">Blockchain Bridge</h3>
                                    <p>Custom bridge technology connecting Hyperledger Fabric and Ethereum for seamless operation.</p>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Secure cross-chain communication</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Event-driven architecture</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Reliable transaction queue</li>
                                        <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Atomic transaction guarantees</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center mt-5">
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-center">
                    <img src="/images/hyperledger-logo.png" alt="Hyperledger" class="tech-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                    <img src="/images/ethereum-logo.png" alt="Ethereum" class="tech-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                    <img src="/images/nodejs-logo.png" alt="Node.js" class="tech-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                    <img src="/images/react-logo.png" alt="React" class="tech-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                    <img src="/images/docker-logo.png" alt="Docker" class="tech-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials Section -->
    <section class="py-5 bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">What Our Partners Say</h2>
                <p class="lead">Organizations already benefiting from our blockchain solution</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="testimonial-card">
                        <div class="testimonial-content">
                            <p>"With SustainableFashionChain, we've increased our organic cotton sales by 45% and established direct relationships with premium brands that value transparency."</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testimonial-author">
                            <div class="testimonial-avatar">
                                <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="mb-0">Rajiv Sharma</h5>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Cotton Farmer Cooperative</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="testimonial-card">
                        <div class="testimonial-content">
                            <p>"The ability to verify sustainability claims has reduced our compliance costs by 38% and strengthened our brand's position as an industry leader in ethical fashion."</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testimonial-author">
                            <div class="testimonial-avatar">
                                <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="mb-0">Emma Chen</h5>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Sustainability Director, EcoFashion</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="testimonial-card">
                        <div class="testimonial-content">
                            <p>"Our customers love scanning QR codes to see exactly where their products came from. We've seen a 27% increase in brand loyalty and 42% reduction in returns."</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testimonial-author">
                            <div class="testimonial-avatar">
                                <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="mb-0">Miguel Rodriguez</h5>
                                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">CEO, Fashion Forward Retail</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
